# ==========================================
Assets/01.Scenes/
Assets/03.Prefabs/
Assets/04.Images/
Assets/05.Models/
Assets/06.Sounds/
Assets/07.Animation/
Assets/08.Tiles/
Assets/flatbuffers/FlatBuffers/
Assets/Resources/
Assets/Settings/

